### Login do GOD
# @name godLogin
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "god@god.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Criar usuário
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:3333/api/users/create
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Criado pelo admin",
  "email": "criadopeloadmin@email.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "role": "user"
}

### Tentar criar outro GOD (deve retornar 403)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/users/create
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro god",
  "email": "outrogod@email.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "role": "god"
}

### Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:3333/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Atualizar
PUT http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nome atualizado"
}

### Desativar
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}/inactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Reativar
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Resetar a senha (envia a nova senha por e-mail)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Excluir (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar excluídos
GET http://localhost:3333/api/users/deleted-users
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Restaurar
PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Excluir permanentemente (rode por último)
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/users/{{createUser.response.body.id}}/hard
Authorization: Bearer {{godLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
